    "current_toolchain_limit": "The parent states dependencies have no explicit -std=c++26 flag. This pass did not inspect a native CMake cache or invoke a compiler; actual CMAKE_CXX_STANDARD/FMT_MODULE values and module artifacts remain UNVERIFIED. Source expectation is OFF absent the overrides described above."
